#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomDeveloperIntelligenceWorkbenchPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Compose the established Language Intelligence, Editor Intelligence, AI
#   Coding, RAG/Knowledge and AI Teacher engines into one Framework-owned
#   developer-intelligence workbench policy catalogue.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing engines remain authoritative. This layer adds bounded ranking,
#   routing, freshness, budgeting, trust and approval orchestration used by
#   Studio and future developer applications.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
